+            <tr>
+              <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">Software Identifier</td>
+              <td align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">A string containing the Software Identifier value from a Software Inventory Evidence Record. This field value <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> first be normalized to Network Unicode format, as described in Section 5.4.  This string <bcp14>MUST NOT</bcp14> be null terminated.</td>
